{
  "name": "Rift Valley",
  "version": "0.15.0",
  "stage": "public-16-plus",
  "description": "Run to Finish! Five rifts stand between you and escape.\n\nSprint, jump and wind-dash through Rift Valley while hulking creatures chase you. Weave through split routes, climb raised shortcuts and jump broken causeways. Time your sprint and wind-dash to stay ahead, dodge warned grabs and collect glowing 3D battery and wind buffs. Amber-eyed bruisers pursue you; cyan-eyed stalkers plant, charge and recover. Finish every course before time runs out.\n\nVote for Crystal Grove's glowing forests and boost bridges, Sunset Ruins' carved temples and crumbling stones, or Neon Harbor's cranes and moving cargo. Each finish opens the next course with a protected landing, full stamina and dash ready. Get caught or fall and join the catchers. Finishers can enjoy the lobby while others continue.\n\nEarn coins and unlock trails, halos, auras and titles. Complete three courses to earn Rift Scout. Solo runs earn reduced coins/XP and course progress, with quick retries and a Lobby option to take a break. Competitive wins and tags come from multiplayer.\n\nExplore the rift gardens, floating parkour, fountain and glowing night sky. Valley VIP adds a styled sky lounge, exclusive cosmetics and a separate activity arena with speed/jump coils and an energy blaster. Gear works only in the VIP Arena. Double Coins boosts multiplayer coin earnings; Prism Trail Pack adds animated trails. Everyone shares the same movement abilities.\n\nControls: Shift / L3 / hold Sprint. Q / B / tap Dash. Space / A / Jump. Follow the short prompts during your first run.\n\nRift Mastery: earn bronze, silver and gold medals, beat your best times and unlock themed trails, catcher skins and victory effects. Practice reached courses with instant retries and separate practice records.\n\nLearn to Run in the optional training lane. Complete rotating daily goals for free coins, race your personal-best parkour ghost and earn the Ascent Ace title.",
